<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-UNITED STATES BEAT PONTYPRIDD 15-13 IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-UNITED STATES BEAT PONTYPRIDD 15-13 IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States beat Pontypridd</p>
<p>15-13 (halftime 8-5) in their rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pontypridd - Tries: Owen, Wyatt. Penalty: Strange.</p>
<p>U.S. - Tries: Curtis, Tardits. Conversion: Williams.</p>
<p>Penalty: Williams.</p>
</text>
